---
permalink: /blog/index.html
pageType: page
title: "Blog | Straight Answers for North Carolina Home Sellers"
description: "Honest guides to selling a house in Gaston, Cleveland and Lincoln County NC — including comparisons of the cash buyers competing for your house."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
  - name: "Blog"
    url: "/blog/"
---
{% import "components/blocks.njk" as b with context %}

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Blog</p>
    <h1>Straight answers for North Carolina home sellers</h1>
    <p class="lead mt-5">
      Including honest comparisons of our own competitors. If another buyer is a better fit
      for your situation, you should know that.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid grid--2">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <a class="card card--link" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <p class="small muted mt-4">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</p>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{ b.ctaBand() }}
